{"_id": "blog-030", "text": "物联网平台的配置历史保留多少个版本？", "category": "known_article", "family": "article-22-s12", "evidence_groups": [["22"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "22", "revision": "6c628a18d85192babfeb1a00706c27375d8d0f3622e1bb3f1d540baf209e90bc", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s12", "start": 23, "end": 200, "quote": "| `PUT /api/devices/:id/config` | body `{\"config\": {...任意 JSON}}` → `cfg_version` +1 → 写 `config_history`（保留 10 版）→ 发布 MQTT → 响应 `{\"ok\":true,\"published\":true,\"cfg_version\":N}` |"}]], "scope_document_id": "22"}
{"_id": "blog-031", "text": "按平台指南，离线设备收到发指令请求时接口怎么处理？", "category": "paraphrase", "family": "article-22-s13", "evidence_groups": [["22"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "22", "revision": "6c628a18d85192babfeb1a00706c27375d8d0f3622e1bb3f1d540baf209e90bc", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s13", "start": 23, "end": 232, "quote": "| `PUT /api/devices/:id/cmd` | body 任意 JSON 透传（**不允许空对象**，400）。**离线（30s TTL）返回 409**\"设备当前不在线，指令未下发\"，不发布。可选头 `X-Request-Id` → 注入 `req_id`。响应 `{\"ok\":true,\"published\":true,\"req_id\":...}`，写 cmd_history（环形 100 条） |"}]]}
