{"_id": "blog-033", "text": "调用 async def 定义的协程函数，会立刻运行函数体吗？请按站内 asyncio 文章解释。", "category": "paraphrase", "family": "article-23-s6", "evidence_groups": [["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s6", "start": 40, "end": 98, "quote": "在 Python 里，用 `async def` 定义的函数就是协程函数。调用它得到的是一个协程对象，不会立刻执行。"}]]}
{"_id": "blog-034", "text": "asyncio 文章里的 Future 表示什么？", "category": "paraphrase", "family": "article-23-s8", "evidence_groups": [["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s8", "start": 162, "end": 198, "quote": "**Future** 是一个“结果占位符”。它表示某个操作未来会有结果。"}]]}
{"_id": "blog-035", "text": "文章如何解释 await 等待未完成对象时交还控制权？", "category": "known_article", "family": "article-23-s9", "evidence_groups": [["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s9", "start": 38, "end": 97, "quote": "如果对象还没完成，`await` 会把当前 Task 挂起，把恢复它的回调注册到那个对象上，然后让出控制权给事件循环。"}]], "scope_document_id": "23"}
{"_id": "blog-036", "text": "协程里直接调用 requests.get 为什么会影响其他任务？", "category": "paraphrase", "family": "article-23-s11", "evidence_groups": [["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s11", "start": 122, "end": 190, "quote": "如果协程里写了 `time.sleep()`、`requests.get()` 这种阻塞调用，整个事件循环都会被卡住，其他任务无法推进。"}]]}
{"_id": "blog-037", "text": "为什么连续写两个 await 不等于自动并发？", "category": "paraphrase", "family": "article-23-s13", "evidence_groups": [["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s13", "start": 1, "end": 23, "quote": "不是。顺序 `await` 仍然是顺序执行。"}]]}
{"_id": "blog-038", "text": "asyncio 文章说什么情况下才真正用到线程池？", "category": "exact_identifier", "family": "article-23-s14", "evidence_groups": [["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s14", "start": 27, "end": 85, "quote": "只有用 `asyncio.to_thread()` 或 `run_in_executor()` 才会真正用到线程池。"}]]}
{"_id": "blog-039", "text": "跨线程操作事件循环，asyncio 文章举了哪个安全方法？", "category": "exact_identifier", "family": "article-23-s16", "evidence_groups": [["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s16", "start": 1, "end": 69, "quote": "通常 Task 绑定到创建它的事件循环。跨线程操作需要线程安全的方法，比如 `loop.call_soon_threadsafe()`。"}]]}
{"_id": "blog-040", "text": "asyncio Task 是靠操作系统时间片切换的吗？", "category": "known_article", "family": "article-23-s17", "evidence_groups": [["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s17", "start": 1, "end": 75, "quote": "不对。`asyncio` 的事件循环通常运行在**一个线程**里。任务切换是**用户态主动切换**，不是靠操作系统给线程分配时间片来切换 Task。"}]], "scope_document_id": "23"}
{"_id": "blog-041", "text": "向量图谱中孤立节点应该按语义还是按几何距离补边？", "category": "paraphrase", "family": "article-46-s19", "evidence_groups": [["46"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "46", "revision": "0c623fb15585bb027a57357b7e1e428754491ae70aaef00187deb71cc3419d64", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s19", "start": 93, "end": 136, "quote": "**必须按语义补，不能按几何补**。按几何最近补出来的线只保证好看，不保证两个字真相关"}]]}
