{"_id": "blog-054", "text": "零知识证明文章的完备性要求是什么？", "category": "paraphrase", "family": "article-122-s6", "evidence_groups": [["122"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "122", "revision": "9c44e9c395e71bf46a37d4aaa39c3eb6674667e8273f2954c560fb197b9d76e9", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s6", "start": 1, "end": 43, "quote": "如果命题确实为真，并且证明者按照协议正确执行，那么诚实的验证者应该能够接受这个证明。"}]]}
{"_id": "blog-055", "text": "零知识证明的可靠性为什么约束作弊证明者？", "category": "known_article", "family": "article-122-s7", "evidence_groups": [["122"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "122", "revision": "9c44e9c395e71bf46a37d4aaa39c3eb6674667e8273f2954c560fb197b9d76e9", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s7", "start": 1, "end": 40, "quote": "如果命题是假的，那么一个不诚实的证明者也不能轻易欺骗验证者，使其接受错误证明。"}]], "scope_document_id": "122"}
{"_id": "blog-056", "text": "零知识性是否意味着验证者能知道秘密见证？", "category": "paraphrase", "family": "article-122-s8", "evidence_groups": [["122"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "122", "revision": "9c44e9c395e71bf46a37d4aaa39c3eb6674667e8273f2954c560fb197b9d76e9", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s8", "start": 1, "end": 42, "quote": "验证者除了知道被证明的命题为真之外，不应该从证明过程中获得关于秘密见证的额外信息。"}]]}
{"_id": "blog-057", "text": "零知识证明中的可信设置为什么要销毁 Toxic Waste？", "category": "exact_identifier", "family": "article-122-s18", "evidence_groups": [["122"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "122", "revision": "9c44e9c395e71bf46a37d4aaa39c3eb6674667e8273f2954c560fb197b9d76e9", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s18", "start": 46, "end": 109, "quote": "如果设置过程中产生的秘密随机数，也就是通常所说的 Toxic Waste，没有被安全销毁，那么攻击者可能利用这些信息伪造证明。"}]]}
