{"_id": "multi-02", "text": "对照平台接入指南与参考固件：retain 在线消息为什么不算心跳，固件异常掉线时又如何发布离线？", "category": "multi_document", "family": "multi-02", "evidence_groups": [["22"], ["14"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "22", "revision": "6c628a18d85192babfeb1a00706c27375d8d0f3622e1bb3f1d540baf209e90bc", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s8", "start": 69, "end": 137, "quote": "- retain 的 `status online` 订阅时被重放，**不计入心跳**——这是 2026-08-28\"断电假在线\"事故的"}], [{"document_id": "14", "revision": "5d9b44d78484b9d8e273f7173a48c0bae30351de02f9df9da5c7dec532c7dc11", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s9", "start": 76, "end": 134, "quote": "└─ 异常掉线 → last will 自动 publish \"offline\" (retain) → 平台感知离线"}]]}
{"_id": "multi-03", "text": "分别按站内教程说明：Git 分支本质是什么，asyncio Future 又是什么？", "category": "multi_document", "family": "multi-03", "evidence_groups": [["16"], ["23"]], "evidence_spans": [[{"document_id": "16", "revision": "7c098855c85ae99737e5cb1d001fefb5c7c4f5f2073ed4954dfb4acf8221b5f2", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s14", "start": 1, "end": 42, "quote": "**分支（Branch）在 Git 中只是一个指向某次 Commit 的指针。**"}], [{"document_id": "23", "revision": "2de495a64348f88db8459850623a3d97991f51cbc55376f2295a0dc2a769cc07", "section_schema": "commonmark-top-level-source-v1", "section_id": "s8", "start": 162, "end": 198, "quote": "**Future** 是一个“结果占位符”。它表示某个操作未来会有结果。"}]]}
